<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: Versimilitude
</h4>

<p>
For our wetlands series, we did 11 drafts of the first-day main and left something in the order of 400 inches of copy on the cutting room floor over the life of the opening two day series (I don't even want to think of what we left behind in the whole 3 year, 30 story series).<br />
<br />
But what I really wanted to say was if you liked The Hot Zone, check out his follow up called The Demon In the Freezer. It's about smallpox. When you're done, you'll involuntarily piss yourself every time you hear of biological terrorism on the news. That book scared the living crap out of me.
</p>
